        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Second Year</strong> is a minimalist typing game where every ten seconds represents a year of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance <strong>Work, Family, and Health</strong> as words appear on the screen — type them before it’s too late. Each decade introduces new twists: promotions, family events, threats, and the inevitable decline of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and reflexes shape the journey, from the optimism of youth to the struggles of old age. When the end finally comes, the legacy you’ve built will speak for itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three core stats</strong>: Work, Family, and Health — each behaves differently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life compressed into minutes</strong>: every 10 seconds, a year passes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decade-based twists</strong>: new challenges as you age.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist style</strong>: clean 2D visuals and atmospheric effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional finale</strong>: reflect on the life you shaped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore mode</strong>: one life, no mistakes — survive as long as you can.</p></li></ul>",
